    {
      "name": "D13",
      "label": "GPIO6 (Led active high)",
      "codeName": "D13",
      "capabilities": [
        "digital_output",
        "pwm_output",
        "led_high"
      ],
      "notes": "PIN_LED / LED_BUILTIN (schematic ref D1, \"Signalling and power LEDs\" block) - onboard LED switched by Q2 (AO3400A N-channel MOSFET) with gate driven by GPIO6/D13_SCK net; GPIO HIGH turns Q2 on and lights the LED - confirmed active-high, identical circuit topology to the redscorp_rp2040_promini sibling's confirmed-active-high signalling LED. Also aliased as PIN_SPI0_SCK (D13) - a deliberate, expected dual-role matching this board's explicit Arduino UNO R3 footprint (pin 13 = LED + SCK is the classic Uno convention); spi_sck capability is auto-supplied by build_boards.js on top of these."
    },
