      "label": "GPIO9 (Led active high)",
      "codeName": "D22",
      "capabilities": [
        "digital_output",
        "pwm_output",
        "led_high"
      ],
      "notes": "PIN_LED_R - red channel of the onboard discrete RGB LED (D4, XL-3227RGB-RF). Switched by Q3 (AO3400A N-channel MOSFET, same part/topology as the confirmed-active-high D13/GPIO6 user LED); vendor README states the RGB LED \"uses MOSFETs...to make it work similarly to user LED\" - confirmed active-high. Not aliased to any SPI/I2C/Serial bus role elsewhere in this board's pins_arduino.h."
    },
    {
      "name": "D23",
      "label": "GPIO10 (Led active high)",
