      "capabilities": [
        "digital_output",
        "pwm_output",
        "led_high"
      ],
      "notes": "PIN_LED_G - green channel of the onboard discrete RGB LED (D4, XL-3227RGB-RF). Switched by Q4 (AO3400A N-channel MOSFET), same active-high topology as PIN_LED_R/GPIO9 above. Not aliased to any SPI/I2C/Serial bus role elsewhere in this board's pins_arduino.h."
    },
